DASH.glossary.hl={m:"Breadth",d:"New highs = NYSE stocks at a 52-week high; new lows = at a 52-week low. Index up while lows outnumber highs = a narrow bounce. Latest session (Fri 30 Oct): 92 highs vs 169 lows (WSJ). Both rose from 62 vs 120, but lows grew more as the S&P fell 1.8%: the selling spread beyond big tech. Watch whether lows keep climbing next week."};
